1
00:00:00,585 --> 00:00:03,255
(Sheldon:)to send the ring back to you.

2
00:00:03,321 --> 00:00:04,421
(Mrs Cooper:)Well, let's not be hasty.

3
00:00:04,489 --> 00:00:06,219
(Mrs Cooper:)Are you sure it's over for good?

4
00:00:06,291 --> 00:00:08,421
(Sheldon:)It's over for me.
I'm done with women.

5
00:00:08,493 --> 00:00:10,363
(Sheldon:)Like when I swore off Pop Rocks.

6
00:00:10,428 --> 00:00:13,628
(Sheldon:)They both hurt you on purpose.

7
00:00:13,698 --> 00:00:15,698
(Mrs Cooper:)You want to tell me
what happened?

8
00:00:15,766 --> 00:00:18,006
(Sheldon:)Are you going to say
it's all part of God's plan?

9
00:00:18,068 --> 00:00:18,898
(Mrs Cooper:)Good chance.

10
00:00:18,969 --> 00:00:21,109
(Sheldon:)Then no, thank you.

11
00:00:21,171 --> 00:00:22,901
(Mrs Cooper:)Well, honey,
don't send it back yet.

12
00:00:22,973 --> 00:00:25,133
(Mrs Cooper:)Your sister's married,
and I'm not letting your brother

13
00:00:25,175 --> 00:00:28,815
(Mrs Cooper:)give my grandmother's ring
to that whore he's dating.

14
00:00:28,879 --> 00:00:32,649
(Sheldon:)Wasn't Mary Magdalene
a woman of ill repute?

15
00:00:32,716 --> 00:00:35,356
(Mrs Cooper:)When your idiot brother
redeems mankind,

16
00:00:35,419 --> 00:00:38,519
(Mrs Cooper:)he can date whoever he wants.

17
00:00:40,924 --> 00:00:43,024
(Bernadette:)I know it hurts now,
but it's gonna get better.

18
00:00:43,093 --> 00:00:44,023
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

19
00:00:44,093 --> 00:00:45,393
(Howard:)Everything's gonna be okay.

20
00:00:45,461 --> 00:00:48,301
(Stuart:)You've got so
much to offer.

21
00:00:48,364 --> 00:00:49,564
(Amy:)Thank you.

22
00:00:49,632 --> 00:00:51,902
(Stuart:)Any man would be
lucky to have you.

23
00:00:51,967 --> 00:00:53,507
(Bernadette:)That's true.

24
00:00:53,569 --> 00:00:55,869
(Amy:)I just hope
I did the right thing.

25
00:00:55,938 --> 00:00:57,268
(Stuart:)I'm sure you did.

26
00:00:57,340 --> 00:01:00,440
(Stuart:)Maybe that's the problem...
you always do the right thing.

